# Limit the module-root bundle context to the two existing LLM Probe apps.
# Inputs: module checkout. Output: bounded source context without caches/secrets.
# Effects: build filtering only; pick over changing the shared root dockerignore.
**
!modules/
!modules/custom/
!modules/custom/llm_probe/
!modules/custom/llm_probe/**
!modules/custom/llm_probe_ui/
!modules/custom/llm_probe_ui/**
**/.git
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/.secrets
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.log
